# The shotgun fired at a target three units away that stands still, a shot a
# second: fifteen pellets a shot, of which the few that hit are each their own hit
# on the part of the body they land on, with a damage of their own between 18 and
# 25 (the engine's own rolls, which the simulation takes from the engine's trace),
# until the target is dead.
scenario shotgun_blast
map bloodgulch
start flat_field 77.9 -166.2 0.32 0.0
target 81.0 -166.2 0.32 3.14159265
weapon weapons/shotgun/shotgun
ticks 330
# aim at the body
input 0 330 pitch=-0.13
input 60 63 fire=1
input 90 93 fire=1
input 120 123 fire=1
input 150 153 fire=1
input 180 183 fire=1

tolerance position 0
tolerance velocity 0
tolerance facing 0
tolerance state 0
tolerance rounds 0
tolerance heat 0
tolerance shield 0
tolerance body 0
tolerance stun 0
tolerance life 0
tolerance hit 0
tolerance shots 0
tolerance age 0
